      "command_or_method": "New documentary dependency comparison against exact preserved pre-edit inputs and unchanged scenario/consumer/oracle scope; historical executions not rerun.",
      "observed_result": "T004 checkbox/closure note now agrees with the already recorded four bounded consumer observations; scenario/spec, skill source, concrete consumer and oracle are unchanged. Recorded scope: Frozen local Host and plugin fixture for protocol rejection; separate bwrap read-probe process for actual filesystem/PID/network namespace isolation. Disposable files only. Neither result adopts or approves an Ox production sandbox. Recovery integration: the updated governance helper resolves authenticated documentary predecessors; the final governance suite and 439/439 recovery observation support that bounded change. These checks do not reaccept the 25 historical criteria or rerun product/skill consumers.",
